<p>This talent allows you to prepare up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 3, 3</acronym> different trap(s) of tier <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> or less for later deployment. (Use this ability to select which to prepare.)</p><p>Designs known:</p><p></p><p></p><p>Traps prepared this way are difficult to detect (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">38, 52, 61, 68, 75</acronym> detection 'power') and disarm (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">47, 65, 77, 86, 93</acronym> disarm 'power') based on your Cunning.  They gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">+25%, +50%, +69%, +85%, +100%</acronym> effectiveness, and can be deployed without breaking stealth <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">62%, 75%, 84%, 92%, 100%</acronym> of the time.</p><p>You are immune to the damage and negative effects of your traps, and traps may critically strike based on your physical crit chance.</p><p>Most traps last <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">9, 10, 11, 12, 13</acronym> turns if not triggered, and refund 80% of their stamina cost on expiration.</p><p>More designs may be discovered via disarming or learned from special instructors in the world.</p>